 Keys

  Move                            Hunks                           Files
  j k        line down, up        J K        next, previous       w          save
  Ctrl-d u   half page            ]c [c      next, previous       e          open in $EDITOR
  gg G       top, bottom          >          copy to right        ]f [f      next, previous file
  ← →        scroll sideways      <          copy to left         Backspace  back to the list
  Tab        other pane           u          undo                 q          quit
                                  Ctrl-r     redo                 Q          quit, don't save
  Search                                                          Ctrl-c     abort, exit 1
  / ?        forward, back        View
  n N        next, previous       v          switch view
  Esc        clear matches        W          whitespace mode
                                  z          fold unchanged lines


  When whitespace is ignored, whitespace-only changes are hidden and can't be copied.
  Mouse: wheel scrolls, click moves, click ← → copies. Shift-drag selects text.
